 AssertFailed txt
⍝ Report a failed assertion (called by assert and assertMsg)
⍝ ASSERT_ERROR=1: signal ASSERT_EN, which RunTest traps to fail the current test and carry on with the next
⍝ ASSERT_ERROR=0: record the failure in ASSERT_FAILURES and let the test carry on; RunTest still reports the test as failed
 :If ASSERT_ERROR
     ⎕SIGNAL⊂('EN'ASSERT_EN)('EM' 'ASSERTION FAILED')('Message'txt)
 :Else
     ASSERT_FAILURES,←⊂txt
     'assert'Log txt
 :EndIf
